  "bug_info": "Summary of configuration for Project: Math\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Script dir: /root/defects4j/framework\n      Base dir: /root/defects4j\n    Major root: /root/defects4j/major\n      Repo dir: /root/defects4j/project_repos\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Project ID: Math\n       Program: commons-math\n    Build file: /root/defects4j/framework/projects/Math/Math.build.xml\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n           Vcs: Vcs::Git\n    Repository: /root/defects4j/project_repos/commons-math.git\n     Commit db: /root/defects4j/framework/projects/Math/active-bugs.csv\nNumber of bugs: 106\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSummary for Bug: Math-97\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRevision ID (fixed version):\nf11d7217fd977897eb3ef6c443770795f947599c\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRevision date (fixed version):\n2008-06-23 13:46:46 +0000\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBug report id:\nMATH-204\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBug report url:\nhttps://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MATH-204\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRoot cause in triggering tests:\n - org.apache.commons.math.analysis.BrentSolverTest::testRootEndpoints\n   --> java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: Function values at endpoints do not have different signs.  Endpoints: [3.0,3.141592653589793]  Values: [0.1411200080598672,1.2246467991473532E-16]\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nList of modified sources:\n - org.apache.commons.math.analysis.BrentSolver\n-----------------------------